---
const BRAND = "ChexLizardDecor";
const SUPPORT_EMAIL = "support@chexlizarddecor.com";
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
    <title>Shipping & Returns | {BRAND}</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main style="max-width:900px;margin:24px auto;padding:0 16px;font-family:system-ui;">
      <h1>Shipping & Returns</h1>

      <h2>Shipping</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>We ship to the US and Europe.</li>
        <li>Shipping fee is shown on each product page.</li>
        <li>Estimated delivery time will be confirmed by email after your order is paid.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Returns (14 days)</h2>
      <p>You may request a return within 14 days of delivery.</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Items must be unused and in original condition.</li>
        <li>To start a return, contact us at {SUPPORT_EMAIL} with your order number.</li>
        <li>Refunds are issued to the original payment method after we confirm the returned item.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Damaged or wrong items</h2>
      <p>
        If your item arrives damaged or incorrect, email {SUPPORT_EMAIL} within 48 hours of delivery with photos and your order number.
      </p>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
